    ## `ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = value`.
    weave set_image_smoothing with c as Canvas, value as bool into result of bool to js.JsError:
        var v as result of js.JsValue to js.JsError is calling js.from_int with (if value then 1 else 0)
        if not v.is_ok:
