    ## Writes `data` (an `ImageData` handle) at `(dx, dy)`.
    weave put_image_data with c as Canvas, data as js.JsValue, dx as f64, dy as f64 into result of bool to js.JsError:
        var args as list of js.JsValue is list of js.JsValue
        defer banish args
        calling args.push with data
        var hx as result of js.JsValue to js.JsError is calling js.from_f64 with dx
        if not hx.is_ok:
            return calling err_of with hx.error
        calling args.push with hx.value
        var hy as result of js.JsValue to js.JsError is calling js.from_f64 with dy
        if not hy.is_ok:
            calling js.release with hx.value
            return calling err_of with hy.error
        calling args.push with hy.value
        var r as result of js.JsValue to js.JsError is calling js.call_method with c._ctx, "putImageData", args
        calling js.release with hx.value
        calling js.release with hy.value
        if not r.is_ok:
            return calling err_of with r.error
        calling js.release with r.value
        return calling ok_of with true

